less - scrollable pager
Executable: /bin/less.sh
Alias: less

DESCRIPTION
  Shows files or piped input in
  a full-screen pager with a
  status bar. Text that fits on
  one screen is printed directly.
  Inside a pipe or redirect the
  text is passed through.

USAGE
  less [file...]
  ls -l | less

KEYS
  Up/Down, W/S, K/J  one line
  PgUp/PgDn, B/Space one page
  Home/End, g/G      start / end
  Mouse wheel        scroll
  /text              search
  n / N              next / prev
  q, Ctrl, Ctrl+T    quit

SEE ALSO
  cat - print without paging
  man - manual page viewer
